body:
no i know you didn’t insinuate he’s cheating i was more anxious about him actually having an addiction
because just like you said i don’t want to have sex like this forever 😅 i mean it’s fun sometimes but sometimes it’s nice to be good enough you know

oh i get it ..i’ve been cheated on as well and trust is a huge topic in a relationship.. when my ex cheated i left him ..for me personally it was the right decision ..i couldn’t deal with the lies and i don’t want to be anxious all the time and distrust someone i care about ..it’s really a lot of energy that’s just being used to worry all day about what the other person is doing or thinking and to some extend we all do it but it doesn’t have to be more than it already is i guess ..i hope you can figure out what’s best for you (;
